<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI3138-HERMES-NO-PRODUCTION-LOADER>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI3138-HERMES-NO-PRODUCTION-LOADER" ;
  triage:title "No production Hermes composition/loader exists for the ATM adapter/bridge" ;
  triage:description "arch-ctm's read-only AI3138-HERMES-HARNESS-REVIEW-1 (finding 2/4, CRITICAL) reports a fresh rg of the hermes-agent repo found zero references to atm_graft / AtmGraftAdapter / HermesGraftBridge / ATM_CHAT_ID. Hermes platform plugins register a PlatformEntry / adapter factory through PluginContext (gateway/platform_registry.py:38-59,231-320); the ATM adapter has neither plugin registration nor any other Hermes entrypoint. ATM only defines injected protocol/request abstractions (atm_graft_hermes_adapter.py:27-32,62-91) and its bridge only runs if some host calls start() (bridge.py:32-66) -- but nothing in production ever calls it. Recommendation from arch-ctm: define one authenticated, lifecycle-owned Hermes integration seam (not necessarily a platform adapter), construct bridge+adapter there, and test its real load/activate/close path." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "integration-architecture" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-graft-python/python/" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-29T23:50:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AI3138-HERMES-HARNESS-REVIEW-1 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-07-29T23:48:39Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-08-01T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:progressNote "AI3138-PHASEEND-QA-1 (commit 14233af8): req-qa, arch-qa, and ruthless-boundary-qa independently confirmed fixed. A single lifecycle-owned production composition seam (HermesGraftRuntime.from_environment, crates/atm-graft-python/python/atm_graft_hermes_loader/__init__.py) validates ATM_HOME/ATM_IDENTITY/ATM_TEAM/ATM_CHAT_ID, constructs AtmGraftAdapter+HermesGraftBridge from host-authenticated callables, and owns start()/close() as one unit. Packaged via pyproject.toml. Workspace-wide duplicate sweep found exactly one production construction site; all other AtmGraftAdapter/HermesGraftBridge construction is test-only. test_hermes_loader.py exercises the real load/activate/close path end-to-end and is wired into CI via .just/run_hermes_graft_bridge_tests.py. Docs (hermes-agent-use-case.md, hermes-graft-runbook.md) consistently point at HermesGraftRuntime as the seam. Whether the external Hermes repo actually imports this seam is outside atm-core's repo boundary and not a closure gate for this sprint." ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3138-HERMES-NO-PRODUCTION-LOADER/adapter-102> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3138-HERMES-NO-PRODUCTION-LOADER/bridge-32> ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "2" .

